---
title: "invest (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check contract not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_stage: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert: revert Paused
    q_check_stage --> q_verify_sig: block.timestamp in active sale period
    q_check_stage --> q_revert: revert InvalidStage
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_min: signature from authorized signer valid
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_min --> q_validate_bid: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_check_min --> q_revert: revert BelowMinimumInvestAmount
    q_validate_bid --> q_check_salt: sealedBidPublicKey matches auction publicKey
    q_validate_bid --> q_revert: revert InvalidSealedBidPublicKey
    q_check_salt --> q_transfer: salt == uint256(investor address)
    q_check_salt --> q_revert: revert InvalidSalt
    q_transfer --> q_update_position: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_update_position --> q_store_bid: position.investedCapital += amount
    q_store_bid --> q_update_total: store encryptedAmountOut, salt, sealedBidPublicKey
    q_update_total --> [*]: totalInvestedCapital += amount, emit Invested
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_validate_bid
        INV-001: sealedBidPublicKey must equal auction ECIES publicKey
        INV-002: salt must equal investor address cast to uint256
        INV-003: encryptedAmountOut contains ECIES-encrypted desired token amount
    end note

    note right of q_update_position
        INV-004: bid data is immutable once submitted
        INV-005: investor can invest multiple times, each with separate encrypted bid
    end note
